name=Bandits Wanderers for Large Maps
id=com.github.teruncius.banditslargemaps
author=teruncius
modversion=0.1.0
versionMin=42.20.0
require=\Bandits2
loadModAfter=\Bandits2,\YANMCBanditsCore,\RealUSA
description=Makes Bandits wanderer groups work on big maps like Real USA.
description=<BR>
description=Bandits sends wanderers between places on the Kentucky map. On other maps they never meet a player and fill up the 100 group limit. This mod replaces those places with points around the online players and sends a group to each player about every 2 to 3 days, shared between players close to each other.
